   110	`src/osd/areas.py` (new), `src/osd/build.py`, `src/osd/cli.py` (`areas prepare`, validate),
   111	`src/osd/records.py` and `src/osd/paths.py` (as needed for `areas/`), `areas/**` (new),
   112	`tests/test_areas.py` (new), `tests/fixtures/areas/**` (new), `tests/test_schema.py` and
   113	`tests/test_build.py` (additions), `Makefile` (copying the new files to `site/data/` only),
   114	`docs/program/charters/E46-*`, `docs/program/evidence/e46/**`. No dependency. `pyproject.toml` is
